A1. One thing you can pay with pleasure. ~ COURT
A5. A complete fade-out. ~ DISAPPEAR
A13. Ring out the old. ~ PEAL
A15. A blonde past thirty-five. ~ SORREL
A16. North Dakota used this before the new deal. ~ ND
A18. This slips under a cold dog. ~ SKI
A19. Peacock action on parade. ~ PREEN
A20. This is always against everything. ~ VS
