A30. Reputed progenitor of humanity. ~ SIMIAN
A32. Loves very well and much. ~ DOTES
A33. Also. ~ TOO
A35. Out of the mouths of babes. ~ ORAL
A36. The only man for her. ~ ADAM
A37. Guaranteed to stop the jaw of the most quarrelsome mother-in-law. ~ TETANUS
A40. Abbreviation for a common gossip carrier. ~ TEL
A41. Gets lit. ~ IGNITES
